    "text": "<p><b>Key Benefits:</b></p>\n<p>• <b>Biomechanical properties: </b>High suture retention and ultimate tensile strength<sup>1,2</sup></p>\n<p>• <b>Biology: </b>Collagen-rich scaffold with demonstrated growth factor retention post-processing including bFGF, PDGF-bb, TGF-b and BMP2<sup>3</sup></p>\n<p>• <b>Ease-of-use: </b>Pre-hydrated to allow for immediate use in operative settings</p>\n",
